#: ../../.opencode/agents/issue-tracker.md:19
msgid ""
"track new issues by keeping a local `unassigned-issues.md` report in the "
"current project workspace or sandbox path using the filter: issue type "
"Bug, status New, assignee empty, ordered by create date descending"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/agents/issue-tracker.md:21
msgid "Guidelines:"
